Note that with  the above method, I loose model pricing informations.
A little dive by gemini on the opencode source code leads to this:

```
Option 1: Use the built-in provider ID (Recommended)
Instead of creating a new provider ("vertex-gemini") and disabling the default one, you can simply override the options of the existing "google-vertex" provider. 
By doing this, OpenCode automatically merges your options with its internal models.dev knowledge base, preserving all limits, pricing, and capabilities for every Gemini model:
{
  provider: {
    google-vertex: {
      options: {
        location: global,
        project: xxxx
      }
    }
  }
}
(Note: You can remove "disabled_providers": ["google-vertex"] if you use this method).
Option 2: Manually configure characteristics for a custom provider
If you specifically want to use the "vertex-gemini" name and keep "google-vertex" disabled, you must manually supply the cost and limit blocks for each model, because OpenCode considers it a completely bespoke setup. 
Here is how you structure the characteristics inside the model's configuration block:
{
  provider: {
    vertex-gemini: {
      npm: @ai-sdk/google-vertex,
      options: {
        location: global,
        project: xxxx
      },
      models: {
        gemini-3.1-pro-preview: {
          cost: {
            input: 2.00,
            output: 12.00,
            cache_read: 0.20
          },
          limit: {
            context: 1048576,
            output: 65536
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  disabled_providers: [google-vertex]
}
```
updating my solution with option2

## 根因确认

经查证 `packages/opencode/src/provider/transform.ts` 中的 `sanitizeGemini` 函数（第 484-525 行），确实**没有处理 `anyOf`**：

```typescript
// 当前代码只处理了：
// 1. integer enum → string enum
// 2. 过滤 required 数组
// 3. 空 items 处理
// 4. 移除非 object 类型的 properties/required

// 但没有处理 anyOf/oneOf/allOf
```

Gemini API 要求：当使用 `anyOf` 时，它必须是该层级的**唯一字段**，不能与 `type`、`properties` 等并存。

**修复位置**：`packages/opencode/src/provider/transform.ts` 的 `schema()` 函数中的 `sanitizeGemini` 需要增加 `anyOf` 展平逻辑。
